C03: what is on the agenda lists what BAXY scheduled; summarising a PDF is a known unsupported effect (AGENDA1669)

«qué tengo agendado para hoy» asks for the agenda: what BAXY has on it are the alarms and reminders it scheduled (there is no calendar), so the question joins the notification.list reader sealed in AGENDA1435 (agendado/programado/planeado, for today/tomorrow/this week, in Spanish and English) and the final says what was observed. «resumime informe.pdf» asks for a PDF summary the text reader cannot give; a known_unsupported_effect_request contract (document.pdf.read) closes the turn as a plain limit naming the request.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


